{
  "_about": "The token tree build_tokens.py turns into tokens.json. www.framer.com declares its design-token layer as ~576 `--token-<uuid>` colour styles on `body` (raw/css-vars.json) — opaque-named paint styles that deduplicate to ~68 painted values: the achromatic ramp, white/black alpha hairlines, the #cbff00 lime and the vivid gradient accents. Everything else is measured. The dark set is the only surface the marketing site paints; the community stack is dark too, the /login auth shell is light. Measured roles alias to the declared values where they match.",
